cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Semantica: Semantic Understanding & Meaning-Preserving Paraphrase Toolkit"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/meworo/Semantica"
abstract: >-
  A research toolkit for analysing semantic, contextual, pragmatic and epistemic
  information in a source text and for verifying whether a candidate paraphrase
  preserves it, with explicit statuses for cases that need a model or a human reader.
keywords:
  - computational linguistics
  - paraphrase
  - meaning preservation
  - semantic evaluation
authors:
  - family-names: Ubaidillah
    given-names: Mohamad Iksan
